          "text": " Naarai naainakinere aiturio ka aibuses nuapotu kama ejai Edeke Papa, kobu da eporoto mamakeŋ kotoma aibuses nakapolou naimwekimweki ebe, “Lo ŋes Okokuka lominat, loalelakinit noi;” ",
          "type": "text",
