              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido kija kakirot naka inabin naitogogoŋitoi aitelekarit, Ido iswamaete ejok aibwaikin ŋin etau, kwape atala naecaikini aibois nakamuton, aitodol naiwalaria akwap, elomuni da etop kotoma otauonokus. ",
